Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:42.68,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.12,0:00:46.44,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,So here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:48.80,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.61,0:00:53.19,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to go \Nall out in a fight against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.43,0:00:57.66,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Can I win if I don't hold back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.15,0:00:59.69,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Why don't we find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:02.75,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.34,0:01:05.25,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Artificial Great Hero Power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.10,0:01:07.50,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Stop the flow of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.15,0:01:14.20,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.53,0:01:19.78,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.78,0:01:23.68,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You can attack me a hundred times, but if each \Ndoes zero damage, that still makes zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.48,0:01:31.07,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Adamantine Body.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.07,0:01:34.38,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,A technique that momentarily\N increases the toughness of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.38,0:01:36.99,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Since you stopped time, \Nit was active all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.90,0:01:39.10,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.94,0:02:04.00,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm an ordinary citizen now,\N so I thought I'd be done with all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.19,0:02:15.20,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,I look in your eyes, and I'm met with
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.20,0:02:19.75,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,A brand-new me and dream
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.79,0:02:32.50,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Bravery? Naturally?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:35.09,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Polar opposites within the heart
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.09,0:02:37.76,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,But, you know, wanting to have both
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:40.39,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,That's the saga of human nature
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.39,0:02:42.95,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Oh no, don't mind me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.95,0:02:45.89,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Go ahead, and so on, you know the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:48.15,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,A little more? Wait, even harder?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.15,0:02:51.06,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Going overboard much?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:53.07,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Those selfish emotions deep down
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:55.65,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Bringing them to light is \Nwhat friendship's about
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:02:58.66,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Spending adolescence duking it out with pals
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:03:01.91,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,I don't wanna lose
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.33,0:03:05.21,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,We're off to the cutting edge moment
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.21,0:03:09.04,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Fight with best friends, and leave no regrets
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.04,0:03:14.00,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,You should laugh, since \Nyou look best with a smile
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:19.63,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,On the ropes?! No matter \Nwhat we face, et cetera
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:22.64,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Just sit back and enjoy it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.64,0:03:29.83,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Whatever may come, I'll \Nbe here to protect you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:39.99,sign_3812_25_Episode_1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(122,75)}{\fad(522,1)}Episode 7
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:39.99,sign_5218_39_The_Springtime_o,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(249,280)}{\fad(522,1)}The Springtime of Life\Nat Rosewood Academy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.66,0:03:44.28,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.28,0:03:46.49,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of \Nmagic or trickery this is,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.49,0:03:48.74,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,but can't we call it quits already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.93,0:03:52.25,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I believe I explained it all at the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:54.00,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,This is no trickery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:57.33,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,This technology known as virtual reality
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.33,0:04:00.55,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,was made using a lost branch \Nof magic known as science.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:03.80,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Also, and I mentioned this as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:08.24,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,there's no need to use a blunted sword
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:10.97,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,or to stop yourself at the \Nlast second as you do in reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.97,0:04:18.32,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,That is to say, it's practical \Ntraining like you've never seen it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:15.20,Class - Top,Cu,0,0,0,,Dragons are the strongest!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.20,0:04:18.32,Class - Top,Mao,0,0,0,,A dragon whelp like you dares to face me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.84,0:04:25.32,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Train as hard as you can in this practicum, \Nuntil there is only one left standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:28.32,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,It's a fight to the death!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.32,0:04:30.45,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What a sick joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:33.67,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's fine and all, but can \Nyou make it easier to distinguish?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.67,0:04:35.49,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I can't tell the difference!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.49,0:04:37.08,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Distinguish between what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.08,0:04:39.41,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's way too realistic!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.41,0:04:41.02,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,The way it is now, even after we go back,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.02,0:04:43.63,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,there's bound to be someone who thinks \Nthey're still in virtua-whatsit,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.63,0:04:45.72,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,and slaughters their friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:49.22,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,That would not do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.51,0:04:53.00,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Well, how about this, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.96,0:05:02.99,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Okay, keep on fighting hard from here on out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:09.06,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,The last one standing gets the right to use \Nvirtual reality however they want as a reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.62,0:05:17.00,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Guess I have no choice \Nbut to end this quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.28,0:05:19.34,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,My lord dearest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.34,0:05:21.42,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,The honor of facing you in combat is mine—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.10,0:05:23.00,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:37.71,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Even as you tear me to pieces...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.71,0:05:39.69,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,how beautiful you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:53.85,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Where are you, Blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.85,0:05:55.27,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hi-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.62,0:06:04.34,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Yessica!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:09.93,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Give it up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:13.13,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Ever since our days in the lower classes,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.13,0:06:15.06,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,you've never beaten us in a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.39,0:06:19.73,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,That may be so, but you \Nnever know until you try!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.73,0:06:22.69,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Yep. The winner is whoever's stronger now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.57,0:06:24.69,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,So, Clay...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.52,0:06:28.08,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Why do you refuse to lose to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:31.03,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Huh?! Well, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.68,0:06:36.64,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Shoot—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.64,0:06:37.33,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Ono!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:38.46,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Kassim!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.71,0:06:41.71,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Uchida!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.09,0:06:44.86,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Huh? W-We won?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.86,0:06:45.96,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,We really won?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.76,0:06:49.02,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.50,0:06:58.14,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.96,0:07:03.48,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I never knew that killing \Npeople was this much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:08.34,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I've been so stupid,\N holding back all this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.85,0:07:13.08,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I guess I {\i1}did{\i0} promise
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.08,0:07:16.16,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,that if you ever went berserk, I would...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:18.00,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,cut you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.58,0:07:23.96,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Keheheh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.35,0:07:27.48,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Endless Flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:40.70,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.70,0:07:42.02,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.17,0:07:48.65,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,It looks like you were the \Nlast one standing after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.65,0:07:50.96,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Well done, Parent!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:54.12,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,I couldn't even tell what \Nhe did there at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.12,0:07:54.89,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.89,0:07:57.70,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,It was so sudden,\NI didn't even feel any pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.42,0:08:01.17,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.17,0:08:03.56,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,To think I behaved like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.56,0:08:05.83,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, you were laughing like, "Keheheh!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.83,0:08:06.73,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.73,0:08:07.67,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Be quiet,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.67,0:08:09.55,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,you superorganism!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.55,0:08:11.47,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No, I'm as ordinary as can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.34,0:08:15.94,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Wallowing in misery is yet \Nanother part of youth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:19.00,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Youth is a splendid thing, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:22.87,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,This is all thanks to my brilliant idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.87,0:08:24.39,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:30.15,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Do you know how much trouble \Nwe've faced thanks to your brilliant idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.09,0:08:38.30,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Oh? Going to have fun with it already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.30,0:08:40.30,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,It's your right as the victor!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:41.79,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Enjoy it to the fullest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.36,0:08:46.19,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Oh? Is that data of ferocious demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.19,0:08:46.60,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:49.17,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Scattered all throughout the level?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.17,0:08:49.62,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.62,0:08:50.67,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Booby-trapped floors?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.67,0:08:51.47,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.17,0:08:53.04,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.04,0:08:57.72,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Don't you think these settings are \Na little too extreme, even for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.72,0:08:59.13,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.67,0:09:01.28,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.35,0:09:08.98,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Can you make him keep on \Nrespawning, even if he dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:11.04,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:13.24,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,How long should I continue his punishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.58,0:09:15.34,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Until nightfall, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.34,0:09:17.24,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:20.49,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm starving! Let's go get lunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:40.39,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Mmm! Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.97,0:09:42.82,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Tonkatsu curry is so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:44.60,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What the heck? It never stops!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.60,0:09:46.31,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Hey, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.31,0:09:48.05,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,When are you gonna get over it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.05,0:09:49.48,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.48,0:09:51.50,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:55.30,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Those four had a tag match,\N and the girls won.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.82,0:09:59.97,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What led to the girls winning?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:02.51,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Claire's gotten {\i1}way{\i0} better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:04.14,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Th-That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.14,0:10:06.57,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,As well as Yessica's do-or-die attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.57,0:10:08.27,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,A woman's gotta be daring!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.27,0:10:10.96,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What led to the boys losing, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:14.58,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Probably their complacency \Nabout their skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:16.97,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,They got conceited and \Nneglected their training.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:21.30,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Not mincing your words, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.19,0:10:24.85,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's for their own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:32.98,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,My back! My back! My back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.16,0:10:38.24,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,When did the king get around to \Nbuilding something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:41.14,Class- Default,Dione,0,0,0,,Oh! I've been waiting for you, Great—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:43.24,Class- Default,Dione,0,0,0,,I mean, Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.70,0:10:45.94,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So, what in the world \Nis this "thermae" thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.94,0:10:46.48,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It says—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.48,0:10:48.59,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,Allow me to explain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.48,0:10:50.16,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:51.75,Class- Default,Eliza,0,0,0,,I'm Eliza!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.75,0:10:55.00,Class- Default,Dione,0,0,0,,Well, in any case,\Nyou'll know when you go inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.62,0:11:00.01,Class- Default,Dione,0,0,0,,Welcome to Thermae Rosewood!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.54,0:11:05.51,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So these are thermae!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.14,0:11:08.65,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,A nice, big bath isn't bad, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.65,0:11:10.18,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,This is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.18,0:11:12.02,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Sophie, let's swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.02,0:11:13.52,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Is that a command?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.19,0:11:20.03,Class- Default,Dione,0,0,0,,Three hero-level warriors were \Nsummoned here to dig these baths.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.03,0:11:22.03,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I can't believe that old fogey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.32,0:11:24.22,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Ya-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.22,0:11:26.45,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Ya-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.43,0:11:29.60,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You're not Mao today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:32.92,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,If I switched with Mao,\Nshe would take off the swimsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.75,0:11:35.13,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.13,0:11:35.92,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.29,0:11:39.55,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Not all the guys here are \Nfive-year-olds, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.88,0:11:49.89,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:51.60,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Where's Earnest?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:53.52,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Ah, I bet she didn't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.52,0:11:54.44,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,She seemed against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.66,0:11:56.94,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I-I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:11:58.55,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Mixed bathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:00.76,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,H-How indecent!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:02.45,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,How shameless!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.39,0:12:07.20,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Looks like you're all enjoying the thermae!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.20,0:12:08.43,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Your Majesty?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.43,0:12:10.45,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Please cover yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:11.78,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.78,0:12:14.67,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Thermae are meant to be entered in the nude!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.67,0:12:17.71,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,We need swimsuits, since it's mixed bathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.49,0:12:19.94,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,Gil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.94,0:12:21.55,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I guess I have to accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:24.33,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I can accept swimsuits...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.33,0:12:25.22,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,However!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:27.68,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Don't wear a towel in the bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.68,0:12:28.72,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:31.60,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,It's a part of our kingdom's constitution!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.60,0:12:34.23,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Thou shalt not wear towels in the bath!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.23,0:12:35.22,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Since when?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:36.48,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Are you an idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.48,0:12:38.48,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Since three seconds ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.26,0:12:42.98,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,Gil. There's nothing of the \Nsort in our constitution...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.98,0:12:45.36,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I want to see naked girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.36,0:12:47.24,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I'd do anything to see them naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:49.22,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,But if that's not possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.22,0:12:51.75,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,I at least want to see them in swimsuits!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:54.50,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Don't you all agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.78,0:12:56.65,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,We do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.43,0:12:59.48,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:12:59.48,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:00.50,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.97,0:13:03.61,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,C'mon, Anna, can't you just take it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.61,0:13:07.01,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Besides, hasn't the value of seeing \Nyou naked plummeted already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:08.97,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Plummeted?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:14.08,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,I mean, during the simurgh incident,\Nyou were running around town buck naked!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.08,0:13:16.10,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That was because I was fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:19.08,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,I have no clue why you're still embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:21.61,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want to take off my swimsuit,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.98,0:13:24.89,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,but what's wrong with taking off the towel?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.89,0:13:26.53,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Everyone else already has.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:28.69,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:28.69,Class - Top,Mob B,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.69,0:13:30.45,Class - Top,Mob B,0,0,0,,Claire's totally right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.69,0:13:30.96,Class- Default,Mob E,0,0,0,,Why does the Empress get special treatment?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.96,0:13:32.94,Class - Top,Group,0,0,0,,Take it off! Take it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:32.28,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:33.78,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'm not taking it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.94,0:13:35.46,Class - Top,Group,0,0,0,,Strip her! Strip her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:36.18,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Take it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:37.45,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Just take it all off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.45,0:13:39.45,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Lay bare your youthful, nude form!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.45,0:13:41.97,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,If you won't take it off, \NI'll amend the constitution!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.97,0:13:46.47,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,From now on, wearing any clothes \Nin this kingdom will be—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.34,0:13:49.69,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Hello! Splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.69,0:13:52.97,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,Everyone, I'm terribly sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:58.78,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Sheesh! I just have to take it off, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.78,0:14:00.59,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I can take this towel off just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.48,0:14:06.31,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Don't stare at me too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:08.99,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sure, I won't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:11.00,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.80,0:14:12.92,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Do you have a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.53,0:14:16.36,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,What happened earlier today...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:19.25,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Y-You shouldn't worry about it so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.49,0:14:21.43,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,That was just a fluke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.43,0:14:23.13,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it, I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.13,0:14:26.70,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,No. We were just thinking about it again now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.70,0:14:29.51,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,It was all because of our lack of skills...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.51,0:14:31.20,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.20,0:14:34.01,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You two really are way stronger than us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:36.59,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hey, Blade...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.59,0:14:37.61,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.61,0:14:41.15,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You know how people talk about \N"rubbing salt in the wound"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.15,0:14:42.02,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:46.15,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I think I now truly understand what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.15,0:14:47.03,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:49.65,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Um, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.02,0:14:51.74,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.96,0:14:57.86,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,You made them cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.86,0:14:59.15,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,She sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.15,0:15:00.24,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yes, she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.24,0:15:03.00,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Clay and Kassim are hopeless!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.20,0:15:04.60,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:09.23,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, cheer up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.23,0:15:10.76,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,All you did was lose once!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:14.01,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,You wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:15.73,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,You've never lost to a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.73,0:15:18.47,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,More like, you don't lose to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.47,0:15:19.88,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Being a superorganism and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:22.56,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I don't let it get to me when I lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:26.52,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Well, I can't stand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.52,0:15:28.80,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind if it was anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.80,0:15:30.86,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,But I don't want to lose against Yessica!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:32.79,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yessica? Why her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:34.60,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:40.25,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,I... l-like Yessica!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:45.04,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I like Yessica, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.04,0:15:46.01,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.01,0:15:48.67,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,I thought you liked Earnest, or Sophie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.67,0:15:50.56,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I like them, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.56,0:15:52.37,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,As well as Cu and Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.37,0:15:54.68,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I like you and everyone else, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:55.46,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.46,0:15:57.46,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. That kind of {\i1}like{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:16:00.40,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,That's not what we're talking about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:01.77,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,How's it different?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.77,0:16:02.94,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,See here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.94,0:16:06.58,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've figured \Nit out, but I like Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.26,0:16:09.53,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Claire... she's so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:13.91,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,She comes off as just your typical girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.54,0:16:18.26,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,but she can be ruthless sometimes, \Nwhich is good in its own way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:19.45,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I see. I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.45,0:16:20.66,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Yessica, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.99,0:16:23.92,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,She seems so free and uninhibited,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.92,0:16:25.68,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,and I bet she's got tons of experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.68,0:16:27.42,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I see. I {\i1}really{\i0} don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.76,0:16:31.65,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,But despite all that,\Nshe's really kind and caring!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.65,0:16:32.90,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Claire as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.90,0:16:34.80,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I {\i1}do{\i0} get that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.13,0:16:38.05,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,So that's what was troubling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.60,0:16:40.22,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,The answer is simple!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.22,0:16:42.89,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,You two just need to get stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.31,0:16:44.23,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.23,0:16:45.32,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.32,0:16:47.50,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Females are attracted to strong males!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:49.88,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Get stronger, and they'll be all over you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.88,0:16:51.91,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Head over heels for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.91,0:16:53.65,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Cu, be a little more serious here—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:16:55.38,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Sh-She's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:56.16,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.16,0:16:59.16,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,But how are we supposed to get stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:17:01.81,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,That's simple as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.81,0:17:04.41,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,You just need special training from Parent!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:06.99,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Ah! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.09,0:17:12.92,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Mmm, so tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.14,0:17:15.20,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,This cake is good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:16.68,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,And chock-full of calories!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.68,0:17:18.93,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:20.58,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.36,0:17:20.58,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Um, Anna...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:22.56,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,We're having a girls' \Nnight tonight because...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:22.56,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,Look, it's so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.56,0:17:25.06,Class- Default,Maria,0,0,0,,Is it about Clay and Kassim?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.56,0:17:25.06,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,I can't imagine life without sweets anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.69,0:17:28.80,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,It's really been a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:31.28,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,They've been running away from us ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:34.82,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I don't think it's a big deal \Nto lose to someone once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.82,0:17:37.94,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Seriously, getting bummed \Nout from just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.94,0:17:40.41,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Why are boys so fragile?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:43.76,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Oh, what if we lost to them on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.76,0:17:45.12,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.12,0:17:47.37,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,They won't be able to recover from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:49.01,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Huh? That's no good?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:50.88,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,What should we do, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:53.51,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,The answer is simple!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.87,0:17:56.01,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Males are attracted to strong females!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.01,0:17:58.20,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Get stronger, and they'll be all over you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:18:00.31,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Head over heels for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.29,0:18:05.00,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Wait, we're not trying \Nto make them fall for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.00,0:18:08.11,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,That's right. We don't see them that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.11,0:18:09.52,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Huh? You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.00,0:18:11.41,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Hey, Yessica...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:15.64,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Why don't we skip practice, \Nand let those two get stronger than us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:18.73,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,No! Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:22.37,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hey, are you two really okay \Nwith things as they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.00,0:18:25.36,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Well, no, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:26.33,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.76,0:18:29.14,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,How about this, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:34.07,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,1,141! 1,142! 1,143!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.33,0:18:38.47,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,These are the lightest we have!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.20,0:18:42.10,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Work those core muscles!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.90,0:18:45.27,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:01.90,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,It's finally time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.90,0:19:03.60,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well, no matter the outcome,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.60,0:19:06.70,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I can at least confirm that \Nyou haven't neglected your training!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:11.79,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,If we win this battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:12.71,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.71,0:19:14.33,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,We'll confess to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:15.58,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Confess!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:34.61,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,No hard feelings, no matter who wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:36.77,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.92,0:19:40.82,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.11,0:19:42.86,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.86,0:19:44.88,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Claire! Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.88,0:19:45.37,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.22,0:19:46.95,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Coming at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.24,0:19:48.45,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,No, you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.46,0:19:57.96,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.10,0:20:08.56,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade, did you teach them how \Nto use their fighting spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.56,0:20:12.52,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I just made them realize they've been \Nsubconsciously using fighting spirit all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.74,0:20:13.76,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.23,0:20:17.35,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Kassim is using wind spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.35,0:20:18.36,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.54,0:20:20.36,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,My chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.85,0:20:24.49,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Fire spiritual energy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:26.87,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Did you teach her that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.87,0:20:28.24,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Just the fire part.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.88,0:20:31.57,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Guh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.57,0:20:32.50,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Fighting spirit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:34.65,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:38.50,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,So it ends here...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.50,0:20:39.74,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Next, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.40,0:20:43.02,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.71,0:20:45.39,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,My turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.48,0:20:53.55,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:06.32,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Well, dang.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.32,0:21:07.87,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,You got us good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.61,0:21:11.37,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Thanks for not going easy on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.78,0:21:12.46,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.30,0:21:15.67,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,We're going to get even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.05,0:21:17.60,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,You go do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.60,0:21:20.38,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Fighting's not even our specialty, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.12,0:21:23.38,Class- Default,Cassim,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.38,0:21:28.02,Class- Default,Cassim,0,0,0,,Did Sophie and Maria teach you how to \Nuse ice and lightning spiritual energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.02,0:21:28.80,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.80,0:21:31.23,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,The other girls helped us out as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.23,0:21:32.14,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.72,0:21:35.52,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,That's not fair, all of you ganging up on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.52,0:21:37.15,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.00,0:21:41.57,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,How can you call it unfair,\Nbeing taught by the superorganism?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:43.90,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Why's she angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:46.99,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,And there's something \NI need to say to you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.99,0:21:47.66,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.09,0:21:50.82,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Is it wrong to fall in love with someone \Nunless you're stronger than them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.82,0:21:51.95,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Or confess to them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.95,0:21:52.91,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:57.98,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That's just asking for way too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.64,0:22:23.70,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,The sunny disposition that \Nbrings a smile to your face
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.70,0:22:29.45,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,As well as the heroic sense of justice
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.45,0:22:34.62,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,They may be a part of me, \Nbut that's not all there is
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.62,0:22:37.32,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,That image of me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.32,0:22:40.04,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Has taken on a life of its own
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.04,0:22:42.71,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.71,0:22:45.13,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Won't you be friends with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.13,0:22:49.82,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Let's shake hands, another self of mine
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.48,0:22:53.24,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,The wounds we cannot bear alone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.24,0:22:55.91,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,The dangers that we keep hidden
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.91,0:22:58.58,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,We're all hiding them within
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.58,0:23:01.57,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,Standing ready to strike
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.57,0:23:04.00,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,The shadow lurking beneath the light
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.00,0:23:08.28,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,The muffled sounds coming from my lips
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.28,0:23:13.76,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,They make me feel that I am alive
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.76,0:23:15.60,OP_ED,Sign,0,0,0,,It's a sign
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.51,0:23:39.98,sign_3812_25_Episode_1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,1)}Next Time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.30,0:23:39.98,sign_33934_427_Less_Than_Human,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,1)}Less Than Human
